        "required_age": 0,
        "is_free": false,
        "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Moving Forward with Cat</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Galileo said<br><i>&quot;And yet it moves.&quot;</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >I thought<br><i>&quot;Perhaps the same applies to cats?&quot;</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >&quot;Moving Forward with Cat&quot; is a physics-based platformer about gravity and pendulum mechanics. Understand the laws of physics and aim for new heights together with a cat.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Key Features</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Unique pendulum mechanics</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Gravity-defying gameplay</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Carefully crafted stages</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Minimalist art style</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Game Experience</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In &quot;Moving Forward with Cat,&quot; you cannot fully control the cat. Instead, you need to think ahead and plan the timing of jumps, swings, and launches to overcome each challenge.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As you play, you'll develop an intuitive understanding of the game's physics and begin to feel the growth of your own playing skills.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Discovery</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Discover stages that change as the game progresses, new mechanisms, and increasingly difficult challenges.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Challenge</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Without direct control, prediction and adaptation are necessary. Each level requires thoughtful planning and execution while utilizing momentum, inertia, and gravity.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Growth</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >While playing the game, you'll realize<br><i>&quot;Wait... am I getting better at this game?&quot;</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Experience the joy of growth that you discover yourself, not joy given by someone else.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >If everything goes smoothly, you can complete the main story in about 3 hours.</p>",
        "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Moving Forward with Cat</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Galileo said<br><i>&quot;And yet it moves.&quot;</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >I thought<br><i>&quot;Perhaps the same applies to cats?&quot;</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >&quot;Moving Forward with Cat&quot; is a physics-based platformer about gravity and pendulum mechanics. Understand the laws of physics and aim for new heights together with a cat.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Key Features</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Unique pendulum mechanics</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Gravity-defying gameplay</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Carefully crafted stages</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Minimalist art style</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Game Experience</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In &quot;Moving Forward with Cat,&quot; you cannot fully control the cat. Instead, you need to think ahead and plan the timing of jumps, swings, and launches to overcome each challenge.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As you play, you'll develop an intuitive understanding of the game's physics and begin to feel the growth of your own playing skills.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Discovery</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Discover stages that change as the game progresses, new mechanisms, and increasingly difficult challenges.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Challenge</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Without direct control, prediction and adaptation are necessary. Each level requires thoughtful planning and execution while utilizing momentum, inertia, and gravity.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Growth</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >While playing the game, you'll realize<br><i>&quot;Wait... am I getting better at this game?&quot;</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Experience the joy of growth that you discover yourself, not joy given by someone else.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >If everything goes smoothly, you can complete the main story in about 3 hours.</p>",
        "short_description": "Earth turns. Cats turn. And you will turn too. Welcome to the world of inertia, a law of physics. A game of gravity and inertia with unique controls for the hardcore game lovers.",
